<DocsLayout title="Contributing">
  <p>MarkRust welcomes contributions. The project is licensed under MPL-2.0.</p>

  <h2>Getting started</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>Fork the repository on GitHub</li>
    <li>Clone and build (<a href="/docs/building">building from source</a>)</li>
    <li>Create a feature branch</li>
    <li>Run tests and clippy before submitting</li>
  </ol>

  <h2>Guidelines</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Keep <code>markrust-core</code> free of GUI dependencies</li>
    <li>Write tests for core logic changes</li>
    <li>Follow existing code style (<code>cargo fmt</code>)</li>
    <li>One logical change per pull request</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Good first issues</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Syntax themes</li>
    <li>Tree-sitter grammars for additional languages</li>
    <li>Documentation improvements</li>
    <li>Website enhancements</li>
  </ul>

  <p>See <code>CONTRIBUTING.md</code> in the repository for details.</p>
</DocsLayout>
